	(text "4.2V TERM:    6.49MΩ       / 3.57MΩ - Terminate boost charging\n4.0V SETPG:   4.89MΩ / 2.61MΩ+2.50MΩ - PGOOD rising hysteresis\n3.3V SETSD:   6.98MΩ       / 2.94MΩ - Enable battery charging\n2.0V SETHYST: 4.89MΩ+2.61MΩ / 2.50MΩ - PGOOD falling hysteresis\n1.87V SYS_TH - Exit cold start & enable boost, not configurable\nSETBK TODO\n\nVSYS rises through the above states, set via resistor dividers of REF.\nSee Figure 43/Table 8 from datasheet for more information."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.076 177.546 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Monaco")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
